The build-aux/install-sh utility has its own MIT/X11 licence.
Belka installs it as install.

config.sub recognises Belka as a target OS. The external hosted-C wrapper
provides the sysroot and illumos link-editor; configure disables
posix_spawn, NLS, and Guile.
